{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hobby Computer Game Specialty Computer Game The main character of a D-class boy in the province</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thinking of the entrance ceremony for Yuseong Technical High School tomorrow, the future is dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the first day of school, I met my childhood friends, Yeon Ga-hee, Naseera, and transfer student Kim Parang</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main character is finally getting golden youth!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pleasant Rebellion! Left and right! I've had a glass of water. There's a hotter game than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're serious, you'll lose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Comedy visual Nobel with beautiful and cute dinosaurs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Gongo Girl&quot; is a visual Nobel game produced by the Ren'Py engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players choose a choice and proceed with the story, and the parody elements that appear in between</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Convince the girls who turn into dinosaurs from time to time to choose the right choice and reach the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Information</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Genre: Visual Nobel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play method: Progress using left mouse button and skip using Ctrl key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtime: 1-2 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Others: Gather hidden challenges, CGs, and CUTs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AI enabled or disabled</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_p